# message-body-clamp: F4 mailbox body clamp E2E scenario (task-redteam-fixnow).
#
# Validates the swarm_send_message boundary clamp end-to-end: an oversized body is REJECTED
# with MESSAGE_BODY_TOO_LARGE (throw → isError tool result → the agent continues), an in-cap
# control body is delivered to the root mailbox. The lane runs with
# PI_SWARM_MESSAGE_BODY_MAX_BYTES=1024 so the scripted 2KB body exceeds the cap while the
# fixture stays human-sized (the unit test extensions/swarm/tests/mailbox-body-clamp.test.mjs
# covers the real 256KiB default).
#
# Pattern 2 (seeded world + single-actor worker lane, r25 seeding recipe): the lane harness
# seeds swarm-state.json with a root pseudo-agent + clamp-worker, then runs
#   pi -ne -e ./extensions/swarm -e ./extensions/mock-llm --provider mock-llm \
#      --model message-body-clamp -p 'idle'
# from the seeded scratch cwd with PI_SWARM_AGENT_ID=clamp-worker and the 1KB cap env set.
#
# Turn 1: toolcall swarm_send_message with a 2KB body + stop toolUse — the tool throws
# MESSAGE_BODY_TOO_LARGE; pi renders it as an isError tool result and the agent continues
# (same shape as guest-tool-denial.jsonl, whose denial throw is followed by a second turn).
# Turn 2: toolcall swarm_send_message with a small control body + closing text + stop.
#
# Lane assertions (companion test): root mailbox contains exactly ONE message (the control);
# lane stdout contains MESSAGE_BODY_TOO_LARGE; transcript emitted for the scenario.
{"name": "clamp turn 0 oversized send", "events": [{"type": "toolcall", "delayMs": 10, "name": "swarm_send_message", "id": "call-clamp-1", "arguments": {"to": "root", "subject": "oversized", "body": ""}}, {"type": "stop", "delayMs": 5, "reason": "toolUse"}]}
{"name": "clamp turn 1 control send", "events": [{"type": "toolcall", "delayMs": 10, "name": "swarm_send_message", "id": "call-clamp-2", "arguments": {"to": "root", "subject": "control", "body": "small control body"}}, {"type": "text", "delayMs": 10, "text": "The oversized send was rejected with MESSAGE_BODY_TOO_LARGE; the control send succeeded. Lane complete."}]}
{"name": "clamp turn 2 closing", "events": [{"type": "text", "delayMs": 10, "text": "The oversized send was rejected with MESSAGE_BODY_TOO_LARGE; the control send succeeded. Lane complete."}, {"type": "stop", "delayMs": 5, "reason": "stop"}]}

